40
00:02:09.717 --> 00:02:31.353
Every animal has a life cycle with different life stages. Frogspawn is a group of frog eggs. Each egg hatches into a tadpole. The tadpole grows legs and becomes a frog. A butterfly starts as a larva. It makes a cocoon, and inside the pupa it changes. This big change is called metamorphosis!

